[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_1A_WOODEN]
Wooden Armor (Air)

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_1A_WOODEN_desc]
100% natural wood, can be disassembled and built into a church, used to pray that the opponent does not carry a flamethrower.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_1A_WOODEN]
木制装甲 (空)

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_1A_WOODEN_desc]
100%纯天然木板，可以拆卸后搭建教堂，用于祈祷对手没有携带喷火武器。
